    "detailed_description": "There is no magic is a casual roguelike shooter action game.<br>Roll and dodge enemy bullets, use your cyberpunk skills, and a variety of magic to wipe out your enemies!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The screwed-up protagonists are waiting for your help</h2></strong>.<br>They may be flawed, weak, and carrying scary diseases, but their courage is unparalleled.<br>Steve the alcoholic, Eileen the anger management disorder, Max the narcissist!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152720/extras/69e11a5a28f75dea25224a1738489a48.avif?t=1736593958\" width=735 height=244 /></span><br>And an assortment of Crowbar's drunks are with you.<br>Join them as you explore the Great Spoils. Cute, powerful, and colorful enemies will beat the crap out of you.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get stronger with wacky weapons and items</h2></strong><br>From precision weapons crafted with super technology to strange magical items you'll never know where they came from.<br>Grow your character with a variety of combinations that you never know what will work!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash the Ancient Elements</h2></strong><br>Powerful elemental forces will rise from within you to strengthen you.<br>There are eight basic elements and 36 combinations to explore.<br><br>We invite you to enter this world of change, chaos, and unpredictability.",
